    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/immigration-consulting/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Immigration Consulting Theme is a premium, professional solution designed for immigration consultants, visa lawyers, migration agencies, legal advisors, relocation service providers, and immigration experts. It provides a sleek, modern platform to showcase immigration services including visa application assistance, work visa consulting, student visa consulting, family sponsorship, business visa support, permanent residency support, green card services, express entry consulting, citizenship applications, refugee and asylum services, investor visas, and visa interview coaching. Whether for Canadian, USA, or UK immigration services, the theme offers a user-friendly interface, clean design, and responsive layout, ensuring potential clients can easily navigate information and access services. SEO-optimized and fast-loading, it features integrated contact forms, appointment scheduling, lead generation tools, and live chat support through the Contact Form 7 plugin to enhance customer engagement. With high-resolution banners, customizable sections, interactive elements, client testimonials, blogs, and success stories, its minimal yet sophisticated design conveys trust, authority, and professionalism, making it an essential tool for building a reputable online presence in immigration consulting. Demo:https://www.vwthemes.net/immigration-consulting-pro/"
    },
